%contains: stdout
run 7: UdpBasicAppData-0 has no packet-level bit error
run 7:   inet::ApskPhyHeader 12 B correct
run 7:   inet::AckingMacHeader 10 B correct
run 7:   inet::Ipv4Header 20 B correct
run 7:   inet::UdpHeader 8 B correct
run 7:   inet::ApplicationPacket 1000 B correct
